{"name":"Crimson Sword","hex":"#b53111","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"crimson","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A deep, slightly bluish red."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a deep red colour.","Immodest. (Can we add an example for this sense?)"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/crimson"},{"term":"sword","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A long bladed weapon with a grip and typically a pommel and crossguard (together forming a hilt), which is designed to cut, stab, slash and/or hack.","A suit in certain playing card decks, particularly those used in Spain and Italy, or those used for divination.\nA card of this suit."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To stab or cut with a sword"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sword"}],"entries":[{"title":"Crimson","blocks":[{"text":"Crimson is a rich, deep red color, inclining to purple. It originally meant the color of the kermes dye produced from a scale insect, Kermes vermilio, but the name is now sometimes also used as a generic term for slightly bluish-red colors that are between red and rose. It is the national color of Nepal."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Maple_Leaf_Red_Ground_2000px.jpg/330px-Maple_Leaf_Red_Ground_2000px.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Crimson"},{"title":"Sword","blocks":[{"text":"A sword is an edged, bladed weapon intended for manual cutting or thrusting. Its blade, longer than that of a knife or dagger, is attached to a hilt and can be straight or curved. A thrusting sword tends to have a straighter blade with a pointed tip. A slashing sword is more likely to be curved and to have a sharpened cutting edge on one or both sides of the blade. Many swords are designed for both thrusting and slashing. The precise definition of a sword varies by historical epoch and geographic region."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sword"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Oaxaca_de_Ju%C3%A1rez%2C_detalles_07.jpg/500px-Oaxaca_de_Ju%C3%A1rez%2C_detalles_07.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Oaxaca_de_Ju%C3%A1rez%2C_detalles_07.jpg/500px-Oaxaca_de_Ju%C3%A1rez%2C_detalles_07.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AOaxaca_de_Ju%C3%A1rez%2C_detalles_07.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/California_Palace_of_the_Legion_of_Honor_120_2015-01-03.JPG/500px-California_Palace_of_the_Legion_of_Honor_120_2015-01-03.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/California_Palace_of_the_Legion_of_Honor_120_2015-01-03.JPG/1280px-California_Palace_of_the_Legion_of_Honor_120_2015-01-03.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ac/California_Palace_of_the_Legion_of_Honor_120_2015-01-03.JPG/500px-California_Palace_of_the_Legion_of_Honor_120_2015-01-03.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACalifornia_Palace_of_the_Legion_of_Honor_120_2015-01-03.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Crimson_sunset_in_Wuhan_%2820250117%29.jpg/500px-Crimson_sunset_in_Wuhan_%2820250117%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Crimson_sunset_in_Wuhan_%2820250117%29.jpg/1280px-Crimson_sunset_in_Wuhan_%2820250117%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedi